sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Publisher as NestJS Service
    participant MQ_Main as RabbitMQ Main Queue
    participant MQ_Retry as RabbitMQ Retry Queue (TTL 20s)
    participant Worker as Python Consumer
    participant MQ_DLQ as RabbitMQ DLQ
    participant DLQ_Consumer as DLQ Consumer (Alert Service)
    participant TeleBot as Telegram Bot API
    participant Developer as Developer Group (Telegram)

    Publisher->>MQ_Main: Publish message (e.g. share_generated)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over MQ_Main, Worker: Vòng lặp thử lại (Retry Loop) tối đa 5 lần
        MQ_Main->>Worker: Consume message (Lần n)
        Note over Worker: Xử lý thất bại (Lỗi DB, Lỗi R2...)
        alt retry_count < 5
            Worker->>MQ_Retry: Publish to Retry Queue (x-retry-count + 1)
            MQ_Retry-->>MQ_Main: Hết thời gian chờ (TTL 20s) -> Quay lại Main Queue
        else retry_count >= 5
            Worker->>MQ_Main: Reject / Nack (requeue=false)
            MQ_Main->>MQ_DLQ: Broker tự động định tuyến sang DLQ (Dead Letter Exchange)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over MQ_DLQ, Developer: Xử lý DLQ & Cảnh báo Telegram
        MQ_DLQ->>DLQ_Consumer: Nhận tin nhắn lỗi từ DLQ
        DLQ_Consumer->>DLQ_Consumer: Parse payload & Trích xuất nguyên nhân lỗi (Error stack)
        DLQ_Consumer->>+TeleBot: POST /sendMessage (Chat ID, Markdown format)
        TeleBot-->>-DLQ_Consumer: 200 OK
        TeleBot->>Developer: Hiển thị cảnh báo đỏ 🚨 (Kèm payload, Stacktrace)
    end
